   "source": [
    "# Titanic Dataset — Exploratory Data Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "This analysis explores the Titanic passenger dataset to understand \n",
    "what factors influenced survival. Key questions:\n",
    "- Did passenger class affect survival chances?\n",
    "- What role did age and sex play?\n",
    "- Was fare a proxy for survival advantage?\n",
    "- How did family size relate to survival?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** 891 passengers, 12 features\n",
    "**Source:** Kaggle Titanic Competition"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "9d1476ef",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
